{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_175_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_175","textTraditional":"一、二十有五年，春，齊崔杼帥師伐我北鄙。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_175_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_175","textTraditional":"二、夏，五月，乙亥，齊崔杼弒其君光。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_175_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_175","textTraditional":"莊公失言，淫於崔氏。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_175_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_175","textTraditional":"三、公會晉侯、宋公、衞侯、鄭伯、曹伯、莒子、邾子、滕子、薛伯、杞伯、小邾子於夷儀。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_175_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_175","textTraditional":"四、六月，壬子，鄭公孫舍之帥師入陳。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_175_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_175","textTraditional":"五、秋，八月，己巳，諸侯同於重丘。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_175_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_175","textTraditional":"六、公至自會。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_175_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_175","textTraditional":"七、衞侯入於夷儀。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_175_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_175","textTraditional":"八、楚屈建帥師滅舒鳩。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_175_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_175","textTraditional":"九、冬，鄭公孫夏帥師伐陳。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_175_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_175","textTraditional":"十、十有二月，吳子謁伐楚，門於巢，卒。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_clt_175_12","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_175","textTraditional":"以伐楚之事，門於巢，卒也。於巢者，外乎楚也。門於巢，乃伐楚也。諸侯不生名，取卒之名，加之伐楚之上者，見以伐楚卒也。其見以伐楚卒何也？古者大國過小邑，小邑必飾城而請罪，禮也。吳子謁伐楚，至巢，入其門，門人射吳子，有矢創，反舍而卒。古者雖有文事，必有武備。非巢之不飾城而請罪，非吳子之自輕也。","sentenceOrder":12}],"overrides":{}}